    44                           ;---------------------
    45                           ; Title: Assignment6B_SevenSegment
    46                           ;---------------------
    47                           ; Program Details:
    48                           ; The purpose of this program is to count up if ButtonA(RB1) is pressed, count
    49                           ; down if ButtonB(RB0) is pressed, and reset back to zero if both are pressed.
    50                           ; The range is from 0 to F, and it can go from F to 0.
    51                           ;
    52                           ; Inputs: RB0(Decrement) & RB1(Increment)
    53                           ; Outputs: RD0-7(7-Segment Outputs)
    54                           ; Setup: The Curiosity Board
    55                           ; Date: March 24, 2026
    56                           ; File Dependencies / Libraries: It is required to include the
    57                           ; AssemblyConfig.inc in the Header Folder
    58                           ; Compiler: xc8, 2.4
    59                           ; Author: Antonio Kassis
    60                           ; Versions:
    61                           ; V1.0: Original
