 29464                           ; stack_auto defines a symbol /name/_offset which equates to the
 29465                           ; stack offset of the auto object in question
 29466  0000'                    
 29467                           ; stack_param defines a symbol /name/_offset which equates to the
 29468                           ; stack offset of the parameter object in question
